peaclock
------------------------------------------
Responsive and customizable clock, timer, and stopwatch for the terminal

Runtime requirements:
  cygwin-3.6.12-1
  libgcc1-14.4.0-1
  libicu76-76.1-2
  libstdc++6-14.4.0-1

Build requirements:
(besides corresponding -devel packages)
  binutils-2.47-1
  cmake-4.4.5-1
  cygport-0.37.12-1
  gcc-g++-14.4.0-1
  libicu-devel-76.1-2
  ninja-1.13.2-1

Canonical website:
  https://github.com/octobanana/peaclock

Canonical download:
  https://github.com/octobanana/peaclock/archive/refs/tags/0.4.3.tar.gz

-------------------------------------------

Build instructions:
  1. unpack peaclock-0.4.3-X-src.tar.xz
  2. if you use setup to install this src package,
     it will be unpacked under /usr/src automatically
        % cd /usr/src
        % cygport ./peaclock-0.4.3-X.cygport all

This will create:
  /usr/src/peaclock-0.4.3-X-src.tar.xz
  /usr/src/peaclock-0.4.3-X.tar.xz

-------------------------------------------

Files included in the binary package:

(peaclock)
  /usr/bin/peaclock.exe
  /usr/share/doc/Cygwin/peaclock.README
  /usr/share/doc/peaclock/LICENSE
  /usr/share/doc/peaclock/README.md
  /usr/share/doc/peaclock/help.txt

